    "guideStep3": "Step 3 · Set the channel and apply",
    "@guideStep3": {
        "description": "Router guide step 3 header"
    },
    "guideStep3Body": "Find the Channel option (often labeled Channel, Kanal or Wireless Channel). Change Auto to the recommended channel from the previous screen. If your router shows a separate option for 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz, set each band to its own recommended channel. Click Save / Apply. The router will briefly restart its Wi-Fi.",
